(Canine Health & Longevity OS \(v1.0\) is built on a fundamental veterinary premise: a dog's lifespan is not merely an unalterable) Tj
T* (genetic timeline. Modern veterinary epidemiology confirms that between 30% and 40% of lifespan variation is driven by modifiable) Tj
T* (environmental and metabolic factors. By intervening early in body condition management, scheduling age-calibrated clinical) Tj
T* (diagnostics, and monitoring breed-specific risk factors, pet owners can meaningfully add years of vibrant health to their dog's life.) Tj
