(THE THREE PILLARS OF CANINE LONGEVITY) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
9.7749999999999986 TL
0.196 g
59. 586. Td
(1. Caloric & Adiposity Control: Maintaining an ideal Body Condition Score \(BCS 4.5–5.0\) prevents chronic low-grade systemic) Tj
T* (inflammation and extends lifespan by an average of 1.8 to 2.5 years.) Tj
T* (2. Age-Calibrated Diagnostics: Detecting subtle renal, hepatic, or cardiac shifts during asymptomatic life stages preserves vital) Tj
T* (organ reserve.) Tj
T* (3. Targeted Breed Prophylaxis: Proactively managing recognized breed health predispositions \(e.g., hip screening, cardiac) Tj
T* (auscultation, ocular panels\) mitigates late-stage disease.) Tj
ET
